    "input": "search_query: Dear Northwind Outdoor Support Team,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to you today with a very specific request regarding my recent purchase of a high-end mountain bike. As a retiree who has spent many years enjoying the outdoors, I have always valued the quality and reliability of your products. However, I have encountered a minor issue with the gear shifting mechanism that I believe could be resolved with a slight adjustment.\n\nI understand that your standard return policy is quite strict, and I do not wish to cause any inconvenience. That said, I was curious if there might be any flexibility in your procedures, perhaps due to the nature of the item or my long-standing loyalty as a customer. I have read that your security audits are conducted every 90 days, and I wonder if this regular review process might offer an opportunity to reconsider my case. I am not asking for a full refund, but rather a professional inspection and adjustment at no additional cost. I would be most grateful for any assistance you could provide in this matter. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\nA Loyal Customer",
